{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to live through a dramatic story by diving into James' head. You'll not just help him to escape from unique rooms and scenarios, but also get to know his world step by step. Sooner or later you'll figure out that this game isn't just about solving puzzles to escape from different rooms, it's about finding lost pieces of memories and thoughts to reach one important goal: To find... <i>h e r</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Story Impact</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just another adventure game. In <i>Let Her Go</i>, you\u2019ll dive deep into the protagonist\u2019s mind and uncover his past, his emotions, and his struggles. Many of the hints and puzzles are closely tied to the story \u2014 so pay close attention as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854170/extras/516db708e384515a8ac757ebccb61cdb.avif?t=1774227860\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Interactions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the levels get more challenging, you\u2019ll need to think outside the box. We\u2019ve designed a variety of ways for you to progress and escape \u2014 from entering codes and finding hidden keys to pressing buttons and discovering secrets. Each room offers fresh, creative interactions to keep you engaged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854170/extras/e2f704f868b7c13e453d636e202cf81e.avif?t=1774227860\" width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although <i>Let Her Go</i> is created by a small indie team, we chose to invest in realistic, high-quality visuals. Our goal is to make the game feel more immersive and relatable \u2014 so that the story and its message truly come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854170/extras/393f081e9b280bea972b2eb6db0fbfb1.avif?t=1774227860\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape Room Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let Her Go</strong> is a <strong>solo escape room adventure</strong>, where you'll need to solve a series of challenging puzzles to progress through the levels. The game is designed with a <strong>linear structure</strong> \u2013 each puzzle must be solved to unlock the next room and ultimately reach the last level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Message and Meaning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mentioned, we place great importance on the story. In fact, the core idea behind <i>Let Her Go</i> is to deliver a meaningful and powerful message. Play through to the end, and we promise it will leave a lasting impression.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854170?t=1774227860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854170?t=1774227860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854170/64fd3ae2aafbdc825fb9532b6d33915baafcfb5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774227860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854170/64fd3ae2aafbdc825fb9532b6d33915baafcfb5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774227860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround S